Enemy AI Basics:
IDLE:
    - If a gunshot is heard, then go to the location of the gunshot.
    - If a footstep is heard, then go to the location of the footstep.
        - DRAW SPRITES FOR THE ENEMY AI INSPECTING THE ENVIRONMENT.
    - If a player is seen, the other enemies nearby are alerted to the position as well.
        - DRAW SPRITES FOR THE AI POINTING OUT THE PLAYER.
    - If an enemy dies, and they are unseen, their bodies are immediately checked upon.
        - MAKE A STATE OF THE ENEMY AI INSPECTING THE BODY.

- CHECK IF THE AI IS CYCLICAL.